---
title: InsufficientMaxFeePerGasError.__init__ (Osaka Exceptions)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_init : start
    q_init --> q_validate : transaction_max_fee_per_gas, block_base_fee_per_gas received
    q_validate --> q_format : msg = f"Insufficient max fee per gas ({tx_max_fee} < {block_base_fee})"
    q_format --> q_super : super().__init__(msg)
    q_super --> q_assign1 : self.transaction_max_fee_per_gas = transaction_max_fee_per_gas
    q_assign1 --> q_assign2 : self.block_base_fee_per_gas = block_base_fee_per_gas
    q_assign2 --> [*] : raise InsufficientMaxFeePerGasError

    note right of q_validate
        INV-005: tx_max_fee < block_base_fee
        when this error is raised
    end note

    note right of q_assign2
        INV-006: Both fee values are Uint
        INV-007: Both values preserved for diagnostics
    end note
